#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2172
msgid ""
"Your own theme: put a file such as sunset.json in {0}/themes. It appears under Theme by its name:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: a theme to start from (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 to ink-2 (the background), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds and nx (each system's), glass, line, good, warn, bad and focus, as #rrggbb. corners: 0 square to 1.5 round. motif: side, none or eden."
msgstr ""
"Kendi temanız: {0}/themes içinde sunset.json gibi bir dosya; uygulama başlarken okunur, sonra Tema altında adıyla listelenir:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: başlangıç teması (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 ile ink-2 arası (arka plan), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds ve nx (her tarafınki), glass, line, good, warn, bad ve focus, #rrggbb olarak. corners: 0 köşeli ile 1.5 yuvarlak arası. motif: side, none veya eden."

